},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井の声が最後まで元に戻らないんじゃないか心配だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とメンバー、スタッフに言われました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/9c097a.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/ac83cb30a657a024faedcffd928d2e20.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年一発目の締めなのに……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと落ち込みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/6448df95a7b389e6584611657c968a57.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のハイタッチの時も、結局涙が止まらず?!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きながらハイタッチしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、その節は申し訳ありませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/moco46.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣き止んでたのに、ファンの皆さんの顔を見たら、安心したのか止まらなくなりまして……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後の反省点です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/997f725aa948b7987ffcd287241e0b70.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもう１つ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相方、若月が無事戻ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"………………………。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと若月の名前出せる〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんが凄く温かく、若月を迎えてくださって、本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、ゆみの挨拶の時、ゆみが名前を呼ばれてステージの前に立った瞬間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すでに桜井の涙腺は壊れてました〜(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生涯我慢してたので、皆さんにはバレていないはずですけどねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/o0020002010626675400.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"eventが終わってすぐ舞台裏で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月と一緒に大号泣した事は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけの秘密です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/decoemo14.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ大事な相方が一緒じゃないと、寂しいもんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局この日は若月と一緒に寝ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/07/o0020002010626675402.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":